Sval: about:license makes no claim about where the source is

Firefox's paragraph under the license block says the build configuration
page names the URL of this copy's source, and links Mozilla's instructions for
building Firefox. Sval's builds set no source repository, so about:buildconfig
shows none, and Mozilla's instructions build Firefox. The paragraph keeps its
statement of the licenses alone. The text is in the page's markup, so no
chrome API reaches it.

diff --git a/toolkit/content/license.html b/toolkit/content/license.html
index 15ec470df7..24845cb98a 100644
--- a/toolkit/content/license.html
+++ b/toolkit/content/license.html
@@ -24,13 +24,9 @@
